    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Monuments to Ruin\u2019 is a roguelite, tower defense game with gridless building placement and a fog covered world to explore. Unlock endless buildings and upgrades and try countless different synergies and strategies to overcome the many challenges to reclaim the land from Ruin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN DEFENSIVE STRATEGIES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely place your defences and watch the enemies choose new paths to destroy your Bastion. But beware, breaking through your defences might become the easier option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct your defences with unique buildings that can define your strategies and allow many different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your buildings after every night with random rewards to create powerful (and sometimes gamebreaking) synergies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE FOG</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push back the fog called Ruin. Reclaim and expand the land you can build on. Change the battlefield in your favour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover all that has been lost to humanity in the fog. Relic ruins, repairable towers and abandoned villages could change the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAN YOUR ADVANCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings and upgrades in an expansive unlock tree. Discover, refine and adapt ever expanding build strategy options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assess the risk of progress in an interactive unlock tree. Foresight might increase your chances of survival. Careless abandon will assure your end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER A SHIFTING WORLD</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight on procedurally generated maps in varied biomes that bring unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contend with fluctuating climate conditions that are influenced by your decisions as much as they impact your strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt around random rewards and create a multitude of approaches. No experience will ever be the same.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Monuments to Ruin\u2019 is a roguelite, tower defense game with gridless building placement and a fog covered world to explore. Unlock endless buildings and upgrades and try countless different synergies and strategies to overcome the many challenges to reclaim the land from Ruin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN DEFENSIVE STRATEGIES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely place your defences and watch the enemies choose new paths to destroy your Bastion. But beware, breaking through your defences might become the easier option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct your defences with unique buildings that can define your strategies and allow many different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your buildings after every night with random rewards to create powerful (and sometimes gamebreaking) synergies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE FOG</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push back the fog called Ruin. Reclaim and expand the land you can build on. Change the battlefield in your favour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover all that has been lost to humanity in the fog. Relic ruins, repairable towers and abandoned villages could change the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAN YOUR ADVANCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings and upgrades in an expansive unlock tree. Discover, refine and adapt ever expanding build strategy options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assess the risk of progress in an interactive unlock tree. Foresight might increase your chances of survival. Careless abandon will assure your end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER A SHIFTING WORLD</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight on procedurally generated maps in varied biomes that bring unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contend with fluctuating climate conditions that are influenced by your decisions as much as they impact your strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt around random rewards and create a multitude of approaches. No experience will ever be the same.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Build defences, explore an all-encompassing fog and pray you can fight off the massive hordes of Ruin. Engage with an expansive unlock system and survive in a world that changes with your decisions. \u2018Monuments to Ruin\u2019 is a roguelite, tower defense game set in a world ravaged by a suffocating fog.",
